{"title": "Last Hope", "pageid": 45119, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Last_Hope", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Last_Hope.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Last_Hope.webp/300px-Last_Hope.webp, /w/images/7/79/Last_Hope.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Last_Hope.webp/300px-Last_Hope.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Last_Hope.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Last Hope</b> is a passive feature that grants <a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\">Hope</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward\" title=\"Death Ward\">Death Ward</a> at the start of combat.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Hope always begins combat under the effects of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Death Ward (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Death Ward (Condition)\">Death Ward</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Death_Ward\"> Condition: Death Ward </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Death Ward (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Death Ward\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Death_Ward_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Death_Ward_(Condition)\" title=\"Death Ward (Condition)\">Death Ward</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The next time damage would reduce the affected entity to 0 <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a>, it remains conscious with 1 Hit Point left.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\">Hope</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202344\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.